@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

title System Sequence Diagram (SSD) - Calculate Earliest and Latest Start and Finish Times

autonumber

actor "Project Manager" as ProjectManager
participant ":System" as System

activate ProjectManager

    ProjectManager -> System : Request calculation of earliest and latest times
    activate System

        System -> System : Perform forward pass (calculate ES and EF)
        System -> System : Perform backward pass (calculate LS and LF)
        System -> System : Calculate slack times for all activities
        System -> System : Validate consistency of results

        System --> ProjectManager : Returns activity times (ES, EF, LS, LF, slack)

    deactivate System
deactivate ProjectManager

@enduml
